# Copy this file to `.env.development` (and `.env.production`) and fill in values.
#
# RULES:
# - Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to client code by Vite.
# - NEVER put secrets here: every VITE_* value is bundled into the browser build
#   and is therefore PUBLIC. Real secrets belong on the server only.
# - Add each new VITE_* var to src/vite-env.d.ts so it stays type-checked.

# Optional. The default /api is right for the image and for `vite`: Caddy in the image and the dev server send /api/* to
# the API (the dev server to API_URL, or http://localhost:3001). Set an absolute URL only to call another API directly.
# VITE_API_URL=https://ecom-nest.t2g.io.vn
